              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neitoki Esta, ina kitok o laiguanani, entito e Abihail o Mordekai ilo Yahudi, aaiger enkitanapata nalulung'a te nkitoria, aaitadedeyie ena palai e are naipirta Purim. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.9.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.9.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
