            "sid": "EST 9:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neigerokini mpala Ilyahudi pooki, ootii lelo oshon tikitam o opishana lo laiguanani Serser, too rorei le seriani o esipata, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.9.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.9.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 9:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nchere ore kuna olong'i e Purim neishiaakino neibung'i too nkatitin naatudung'okoki, anaa enaitanapa Mordekai ilo Yahudi o Esta enkitok o laiguanani Ilyahudi, o ina sii nairuko aaibung ninche maate o nkera enye mbaa naaipirta eenata o enkishirata enye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.9.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.9.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
